SCHOOLOS AI — COMPLETE JUDGE DEMO AND PRESENTATION GUIDE
=======================================================

This is the combined replacement for JUDGE-DEMO-GUIDE.txt and
JUDGE-PRESENTATION-GUIDE.txt. It is aligned with the public homepage and
public/user-guide.html: visitors can explore six role-specific sign-in paths,
learn first steps, review AI/privacy notes, and start a school registration
request. Inside the existing application, all 15 AI & Smart Features modules
are centrally accessible to administrators. Navigation can still be hidden by
Feature Control, and users see only records their account may access. Treat
anything needing credentials, host services, camera permissions, or another
live participant as setup-dependent until actually demonstrated.

